# pcsc_sim.jgs -- jgraph.pcsc.readers, connect, transmit, control, status, the transaction calls,
# reconnect, disconnect and watch on jgraph.internal.pcscsim's readers (device classes plan, stage D12,
# ADR 0196). JGraph-only: jgraph.pcsc is a JGraph extension with no MATLAB counterpart, so
# expected/pcsc_sim.txt is written from the rule. The cases are MATLAB code in helpers/pcsc_sim_case.m.

